      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow-ups come in a later version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "补充消息将在后续版本支持"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a v=1 link, run pnpm --dir bridge build from the updated dsh-mobile project folder. Restart DSH with the same profile, then run node bridge/lib/scripts/pair.js in another terminal with the same DSH_HOME and scan the new v=2 code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果链接里是 v=1，请在更新后的 dsh-mobile 项目目录运行 pnpm --dir bridge build，用原来的 profile 重启 DSH，再在另一个终端使用相同的 DSH_HOME 运行 node bridge/lib/scripts/pair.js，扫描新生成的 v=2 码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep DSH running. In another terminal, open the dsh-mobile project folder and use the same DSH_HOME. Run this command for a new or expired code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持 DSH 运行。在另一个终端进入 dsh-mobile 项目目录，使用与 DSH 相同的 DSH_HOME，运行以下命令。配对码过期时可再次运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent reads it at its next step": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent 下一步读到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Goes in at the next step": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一步发送"
          }
